  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN252.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟattāṉākat tōḻikkut talaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What SHE said to the confidante while HE was behind the hedge.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN252.1">
        <l>iṭampaṭu paṟiyā valampaṭu vēṭṭattu</l>
        <l>vāḷvari naṭuṅkap pukalvan<anchor n="1"/> tāḷi</l>
        <l><anchor n="2"/>yuyarnutal yāṉaip pukarmukat toṟṟi</l>
        <l>veṇkōṭu puykkun<anchor n="3"/> taṇkamaḻ cōlaip</l>
        <l>peruvarai yaṭukkat toruvē lēntit</l>
        <l>taṉiyaṉ varuta lavaṉu mañcāṉ</l>
        <l>paṉivār <anchor n="4"/>kaṇṇē ṉāki nōyaṭa</l>
        <l><supplied>ve</supplied>miyē ṉiruttalai yāṉu māṟṟēṉ</l>
        <l>yāṅkuccey vāṅko ṟōḻi <supplied>yī</supplied>ṅkait</l>
        <l>tuyyaviḻ paṉimala rutira vīcit</l>
        <l><supplied>to</supplied>ḻiṉmaḻai pōḻnta pāṉāṭ kaṅku</l>
        <l>leṟitirait tivalai tū<supplied>u</supplied>ñ <supplied>ci</supplied>ṟukōṭṭup</l>
        <l>peruṅkuḷaṅ kāvalaṉ pōla</l>
        <l>varuṅkaṭi yaṉṉaiyun tuyiṉmaṟan taṉaḷē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="4cd">In the cool fragrant grove, where</l>
        <l corresp="2">the Āḷi, coming joyfully, so that the sickle-striped [tiger] trembles,</l>
        <l corresp="1">on the hunt [for prey] that does not know of falling to the left [but] falls to the right,</l>
        <l corresp="3">presses the spotted face of the elephant a with high forehead</l>
        <l rend="indent5" corresp="4ab">[and] pulls out [its] white tusks,</l>
        <l corresp="5">on the side of the great mountain, raising a single spear</l>
        <l corresp="6">he is not afraid of coming alone,</l>
        <l corresp="7">and, me with eyes flowing over with tears, as pain kills [me],</l>
        <l corresp="8">I cannot bear sitting [here] as one of our [people only],</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">– What shall we do, friend? –</l>
        <l corresp="11">and deep at night crossed by rain [clouds] busy</l>
        <l corresp="9d-10">with pouring down, so that open mimosa blossoms drop [their] filaments,</l>
        <l corresp="13">like a watchman of the big pond</l>
        <l corresp="12">on a small peak where dashing waves spatter spray,</l>
        <l corresp="14">mother, fiercely protective, has forgotten sleep.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

